th: 482.156px;background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><section nodeleaf="" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-align: center;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-aistatus="1" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Trgic5JCmc3wFRBs1ibhMdEvYO7VKHm3vTsUJc5iaqwOpqNQ8YBmCNlgegeOHmKPicCb3IN080s2ia1iaGEOd4I8X3EDq7s8RCRAojKIHCwvGjBQQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="482" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="321" data-imgfileid="506864033" data-ratio="0.66484375" data-s="300,640" data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9df3de8749.jpg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1280" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: bottom;width: 100%;background-color: transparent;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9df3de8749.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;text-align: left;line-height: 1.6em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><section powered-by="xmyeditor.com" data-md5="8646c" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin: 20px 19.2756px 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;display: inline-block;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><section powered-by="xmyeditor.com" data-md5="8646c" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;letter-spacing: 0px;margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: #DB3F14;font-size: 15px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: #DB3F14;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">首款产品定位“个人 CNC 工作站”，将于今年 11 月开启众筹。</span></span><span data-mpa-action-id="mvhwf609k8r"></span></strong></section><p style="margin: 24px 0px 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span style="margin-right: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;color: #B2B2B2;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="" style="margin-right: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">作者丨姚单</span></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></span></p><section powered-by="xmyeditor.com" data-md5="8646c" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span style="margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;color: #B2B2B2;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">编辑丨董子博</span></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></span></section></section></section><section powered-by="xmyeditor.com" data-md5="8646c" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(70, 70, 72);font-size: 18px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><section powered-by="xmyeditor.com" data-md5="8646c" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;width: 482.145px;display: inline-block;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;display: inline-block;width: 482.145px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><br/></span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section data-mpa-action-id="mvhwi6f61463" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">雷峰网·鲸犀独家获悉，桌面 CNC 公司灵钜创新（品牌名 CubiFab）近期完成数千万元天使轮融资，由南山战新投、龙华资本联合投资。此前，啟赋资本参与了其种子轮投资。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">灵钜创新</span></span><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4ODUxNjIwMg==&mid=2654346859&idx=1&sn=9f9ed6e718a5f8166697a1ce033e4376&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">以 x86 为技术底座，把 AI 算力与实时控制放到机器端侧（Edge）</span></a></span><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">。首款桌面 CNC 产品 CubiFab C1 定位“个人 CNC 工作站”，面向全球 Maker，帮助用户在自己的桌面上完成从设计到金属功能件的闭环。</span></span></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;">CubiFab C1 和传统产品不同，一开始想要的，就是打破 CNC 的操作门槛。</span><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在 ± 0.01 mm 的加工精度之外，C1 还具备了 AI 工艺辅助与视觉刀具自动化等易用功能，让小白可以更轻松地上手，并且可以依托模块化硬件实现多材料加工，把小批量制造能力提供给家庭桌面。</span></span></p><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">过去十五年，消费级制造完成了两波浪潮——3D 打印让“造出形状”变简单，桌面激光让“加工软性材料”变简单。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">但 3D 打印容易受限材质，存在天然局限，往往停留在“原型”而非“成品”；传统 CNC 好用但不好学，让不少用户望而生畏，无法真正用起来。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">但真正需要强度、公差与真实材料的功能件，例如金属支架、精密夹具、机器人结构件、散热与传动零件，仍然只能回到工厂。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">与此同时，AI 硬件、机器人与具身智能创业升温，研发端对快速迭代、小批量制造的需求不断增加，个人与小团队也越来越需要自主加工金属零件。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">由此，市场出现了一道真实的“断层”：消费级产品难以稳定加工硬金属，多工序依赖人工换刀；工业级设备又在价格、体积、噪音、粉尘与安全要求上，注定属于车间而非书房。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">中间那个“放在真实生活与工作场景里、安全封闭、能切金属、又不要求先学半年 CAM ”的位置，长期无人真正做透——这正是 CubiFab C1 的出发点。</span></span></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">灵钜创新的核心团队成员来自 Intel、Apple、DJI、Anker、Bambu Lab 等企业与机构，同时具备工业控制与精密制造的工程底子，以及消费级硬件量产、出海和用户体验落地的能力。</span></span></p><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;margin-top: 24px;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">据悉，首款产品 CubiFab C1 将于 2026 年 11 月登陆 Kickstarter，面向全球用户开启众筹。</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">公司表示，众筹所得将主要用于首批产能准备、全球物流与服务体系建设，以及后续产品与工艺的持续迭代。</span></span></section></section></section><section style="text-align: center;" nodeleaf=""><img  class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-aistatus="1" data-imgfileid="506863119" data-ratio="0.40816326530612246" data-s="300,640" data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9df3e10895.jpg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="735" type="block"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9df3e10895.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" nodeleaf=""><img  class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-aistatus="1" data-imgfileid="506863188" data-ratio="0.4087193460490463" data-s="300,640" data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9df3e30959.jpg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="734" type="block"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9df3e30959.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="display: none;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
<category>智能硬件</category>
<comments>https://www.leiphone.com/category/weiwu/ofJthQTqIHVZaF0M.html#comments</comments>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:06:00 +0800</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
<title>Flowtica Rian：硬件的旧规律没变，新机会是做好Memory丨未来创新50人</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/weiwu/Sni49oUOM9rbTR7h.html</link>
