ot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: normal;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;font-weight: bolder;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.5px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></strong></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mvhxhw8pnmu" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">本月初在匹兹堡闭幕的 IROS 2026 将最佳论文奖颁给了 LT-Mem，这项研究让机器人重访同一空间时，能完整保留每个物体的位置变迁史，而非仅仅记住最新一次看到的样子。评委会从近两千篇收录论文中选中它，想必不仅是认可其扎实的工作，也是代表学界宣告：</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">具身长记忆（long-term embodied memory）已经从一个工程补丁，变成了机器人领域公认的科学问题。</span></span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">从实际角度考虑，通用机器人要规模化落地，需要以小时、天乃至周为单位持续运行，而不只是几分钟。没有长记忆，每次相遇都是初次见面，机器人只是一个个孤立的单次动作执行器；有了长记忆，它才能从一次性工具变成可以长期上岗的同事。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">但解决这件事远不是扩大上下文窗口那么简单：持续涌入的多模态数据既无法全部存储，也无法全部检索；现实世界还在不断变化，新的观察既不能简单覆盖旧的，也不能无序堆叠；更棘手的是，一条错误的记忆会在之后的决策里被反复调用，错误由此层层放大。记忆如何写入、如何留证、如何纠错，都是需要被正面回答的问题，靠调几个工程参数解决不了。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">AI科技评论（雷峰网公众号）注意到，在这一方向被顶会加冕的数月前，国内具身初创公司贝塔无限就已坐上牌桌。今年五月，贝塔的联合创始人陶帅在采访中明确表示：</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">长效、多模态、时空记忆的缺失</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，是他们首先要重点突破的方向。随后，团队陆续发布 BetaMem 全时空多模态记忆架构、世界动作模型 BetaWAM 0.1、首款机器人多米。10 月 20 日，团队把 BetaMem 的写入学习、证据管理和自我改进机制写成了系统的方法与实验，挂上 arXiv。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;ac981269-8752-4a68-a846-148b7d7f84db&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:258,&quot;width&quot;:630,&quot;currHeight&quot;:258,&quot;currWidth&quot;:630,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:258,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:630,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FFjFdblMIWoP5upxlKyOcn6tQnag%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;FjFdblMIWoP5upxlKyOcn6tQnag&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:41705,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad971ff4e864.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.4095238095238095" data-type="png" data-w="630" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="630" data-height="258" data-backw="546" data-backh="224" data-imgfileid="100263880" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad971ff4e864.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">论文交出的成绩单颇为亮眼：BetaMem 采用 9B 开源模型生成记忆，在 M3-Bench-robot、LoCoMo、OpenEQA 和 EgoLifeQA&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">四项代表性记忆基准的对比评测中均取得 SOTA 成绩</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">尤其在串联多次观察中的线索、回忆长时间跨度的事件、识别个人习惯等任务上，BetaMem 展现出明显优势——这些能力，正是机器人进入生活、持续积累对人与环境的了解所需要的。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">LT-Mem 从多会话建图切入，把问题收窄到干净、可评测；BetaMem 则从记忆如何形成、如何验证、如何从失败中学习的系统视角，搭建完整的记忆底座。一边是顶尖学术单点攻坚摘得顶会桂冠，一边是国内团队以产业落地为目标搭建完整记忆底座，学术和产业在此交汇，足以证明长记忆是整个领域正在收敛的核心方向判断。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvhxjp881ydt"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad971ff816ff.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad971ff816ff.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">01</span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">记忆这道题，学界做到哪一步</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">围绕机器人长期记忆，学界探索了许多方法。按年份罗列意义不大，AI科技评论（雷峰网公众号）想换个角度，看记忆回答了什么问题，还剩什么没回答。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">第一类关注</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">空间侧的记忆</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，也就是“这里有什么”。Hydra、ConceptGraphs 等三维场景图把物体、地点、房间组织成可被语言查询的关系网，Khronos 把时间引入动态环境建图，DynaMem 让移动操作机器人在物体被挪动后继续更新记忆，真机上对非静止物体的取放成功率平均达 70%，是静态系统的两倍以上。这一支空间关系清楚，但记住的主要是当下这一版世界长什么样。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">第二类关注</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">检测类的记忆</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，也就是“我见过什么”。ReMEmbR 把长时导航视频建成可检索的时空记忆，供智能体推理。但检索按相似度排序，取回的是过去的信息。五分钟前桌上确实有杯子，现在还在不在呢？检索不负责回答。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">第三类关注</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">变化侧的记忆</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，也就是“它变了没有”。LT-Mem 正是这一思路。论文把现有系统的毛病命名为“时间性失忆”：要么用新观测覆盖旧状态，要么存下语义快照却没有跨次访问一致的物体身份。它用一个随物体习性变化的易变性分数，决定新观察该覆盖、保持还是并存。作者也坦承局限：测试只覆盖两个室内加一个室外场景、各 10 次访问，外观相似物体的身份关联依然困难。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">第四类关注</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">操作侧的记忆</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，也就是“我做到哪了”。MemoryVLA 指出主流 VLA 普遍忽视时序上下文，补上工作记忆与记忆库后，长时程任务真实成功率比最强基线高出 26 个百分点；MEM 用视频承载短时记忆、自然语言承载长时记忆，可跟踪长达十五分钟的任务，同时提醒，设计糟糕的记忆会因放大虚假相关而损害性能。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">四支各答一问，拼在一起，仍然有三道题敞开。其一，空间侧与操作侧各自生长、很少碰头，前者可以跨周存在却不进入手的动作，后者进了动作但寿命以分钟计。其二，写什么、留什么、何时核对，多靠人工设计，文本 Agent 已用强化学习学会管理记忆，具身记忆还缺同等成熟的做法。其三，记忆能否追溯到证据？多数系统存的是描述，原始画面和声音在摘要之后就找不回来了。一条记录凭什么可信、出错后怎么复查，家庭场景里迟早被用户问到。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">有意思的是，学界目前分散留下的这三大空白，贝塔无限的 BetaMem 方案给出了一套完整对应的解法。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;0b61f423-df75-441b-94cd-c6cadd1638d7&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:345,&quot;width&quot;:630,&quot;currHeight&quot;:345,&quot;currWidth&quot;:630,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:345,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:630,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FEWxXbE0PeoSk5jxNJdQcKYITnpb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;EWxXbE0PeoSk5jxNJdQcKYITnpb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:195855,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad971ffb23c7.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5476190476190477" data-type="png" data-w="630" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="630" data-height="345" data-backw="546" data-backh="299" data-imgfileid="100263881" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad971ffb23c7.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">从记住钥匙的去向到主动寻找并重新确认——BetaMem 将记忆构建、检索验证与规则改进串成完整流程</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvhxka8ooe4"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad971ffeb78b.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad971ffeb78b.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">02</span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">把记忆做成一份有出处、</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">有保质期的判断</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">BetaMem 的出发点，是</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">把记忆看作机器人对世界的判断</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，而不是一份日志。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">论文把它落成三个互相关联的结构：时态状态图，记录现在认为世界是什么样；只追加的事件日志，记录状态是怎么变成这样的；有限容量的源数据档案，留存选定的原始图像与音频。三者共用实体、事件和来源标识。档案容量有限，哪些原始画面整帧保留，哪些裁剪、降质或删除，要在存储与读取预算下权衡。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这样拆，等于</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">把证据和状态分开</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">用法庭作比，证据是案卷，状态是判决，判决可以改判，案卷不能涂改。只存证据不估状态，系统知道看过什么，却说不清现在是什么样；只存状态不留证据，一次误判会被固化，出了错也无从归因。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">每条状态记录除内容外，还带着空间上下文（所在地点或容器、坐标系、地图版本）、置信度、来源和版本号，并标明状态：已观察、推断、冲突、过期或未知。时间分成三种：所述事情的有效区间、看到它的时间、写进记忆的时间。转变时间不确定就记成区间，超出直接观察的内容一律标为推断。这像一本带出处和保质期的台账，事后纠错不会丢掉原始拍摄时间。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在此之上，</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">记忆分为六层</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">L0 工作记忆装当前观察、任务阶段和动作历史；L1 空间、L2 实体、L3 情景三层互相引用，一次情景中的状态转变可以修订实体状态，并通过 L1 挂到具体的地点和地图版本；L4 经验记忆沉淀规律，L5 程序记忆存放任务前置条件、可调用技能、预期观察和恢复分支。事件日志和源档案贯穿六层，记忆经过整合与修订，出处也不会丢。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;713a44ab-87ad-4588-987f-6373d58691b2&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:392,&quot;width&quot;:617,&quot;currHeight&quot;:392,&quot;currWidth&quot;:617,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:392,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:617,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FXj9AbzA85oZTlTxqBI9cxA3Bnlh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Xj9AbzA85oZTlTxqBI9cxA3Bnlh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:133064,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad97200212f6.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6353322528363047" data-type="png" data-w="617" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="617" data-height="392" data-backw="546" data-backh="347" data-imgfileid="100263883" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad97200212f6.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">以论文里的钥匙为例，拿起、交接、放入是三个独立事件，各自记录执行人，并链接到带时间戳的画面和音频；语音转写保留说话人，并链回原始音频。检索时，机器人分得清谁拿到了钥匙、谁把它放好，也分得清说出口的打算、转述的结果和亲眼观察到的变化。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">写入同样有门槛。每段观察先登记来源和采集时间，再切成窗口；模型输出带来源引用的实体、关系和事件提案，经外观、位置、时间连续性与已有身份比对，拿不准的就保留多个候选假设。提交前，还要核对来源证据、时效范围和所用记录的版本。通过后追加一条事件、更新状态，旧状态留在历史里。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">其中最关键的一条原则是，</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">历史记录只是搜索线索，不是现状证明</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">钥匙最后一次是在抽屉里被看到的，机器人据此去抽屉查看，拿到新观察后，才追加新版本的状态。现在的真，要靠现在的观察来确认。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这套思路与 LT-Mem 保守更新的逻辑相通，覆盖面更大，状态里不只有物体的位置，还包括任务进度、容器开合和动作结果。陶帅曾公开表示，记忆系统能复用他此前在千人千面推荐系统中积累的经验。把推荐系统处理不确定性、漂移偏好、过期判断的成熟范式迁移到机器人时空记忆，是一个很巧妙的跨界迁移，也让 BetaMem 的底层设计自带一套经过产业验证的不确定性治理思路。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvhxkusb12cc"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9720056482.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9720056482.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">03</span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">让同一份状态进到手里</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">如果状态只服务规划器，仍然停在前文说的缝隙里。贝塔无限的做法，是</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">让模型、Agent 和动作三层读取同一份状态，各取所需的时间尺度</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">BetaMem 与世界动作模型 BetaWAM 同在统一大脑 BetaBrain 内，原则是分工保留、状态共享，否则规划、控制和预测各缓存一份世界，会越走越偏。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;ab8c5981-445a-401b-a109-1f93aae5f956&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:676,&quot;width&quot;:1080,&quot;currHeight&quot;:676,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:676,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FF7rnbf5TBoRCa6x7I8Ycp9vznpe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;F7rnbf5TBoRCa6x7I8Ycp9vznpe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:722903,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad97200a88f3.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6259259259259259" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="676" data-backw="546" data-backh="342" data-imgfileid="100263884" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad97200a88f3.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">动作层需要两种记忆。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">一种是</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">短时的动作与感知记忆</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">机械臂伸过去的一瞬间，目标常被自己的手臂遮住。拧瓶盖要转好几圈，如果只看当前几帧，机器人将分不清拧到第几圈。BetaMem 把这次操作到现在发生了什么，压成少量持续更新的变量，包括执行到哪个相位、目标最后确认的位姿、近几次接触的力反馈。小偏差在这一层消化，超过阈值才写回任务状态，触发重试、换技能或上报。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">另一种是</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">跨回合的物理经验</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">柜门要先抬再拉，玻璃杯外壁有水很滑，这类单次交互学到的常识，通常随回合结束就丢了。BetaMem 把它们写成对象级、环境级的可复用条目，供动作模型调用，再沉淀进策略。这恰好对上前面说的缺口，让记忆跨过回合的边界。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">动作做完之后是验证。世界模型先依据记忆中的完整状态，包括此刻看不见但先前确认过的部分，预测动作后的结果，验证器再与视觉、力觉、位姿等真实反馈比对。误差可接受就提交检查点，局部偏差退回动作循环，假设失效则回到 BetaBrain 重新规划。多大的误差算异常，不靠人为设定阈值，而是从该物体、该动作的历史偏差里学出来。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvhxld5b1bfi"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad97200e3e58.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad97200e3e58.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">04</span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">让记忆越用越好</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">机器人出了错，可能是动作没做好，也可能是关键线索没写进去、召回时机不对、过期状态没纠正。只按任务成败更新动作模型，记忆的毛病会留着。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">贝塔无限把记忆策略和行为策略放进同一个反馈框架联合优化，奖励同时看任务完成、关键证据覆盖、状态一致性、失败恢复、用户满意度、执行效率、长期收益和安全风险八件事。这套联合优化框架跳出了只优化动作的常规思路，把记忆本身变成一个持续学习、持续进化的模块，是极具创新性的一步。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">新发布的论文展示了 BetaMem 的两项关键设计：</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">让小模型学会形成可靠记忆，让记忆策略能够从任务失败中持续改进。</span></span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在记忆形成上，团队通过监督微调与 GRPO 强化学习，训练小模型关联当前观察与历史信息，记录对象状态及其变化。奖励依据来自多次独立记录和原始画面复核：有证据支持却容易遗漏的线索获得更高权重，编造、歪曲和错误关联受到惩罚。由此，记忆的完整性、真实性与时序一致性，都成为具体的学习目标。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在策略改进上，贝塔无限设计了由失败反馈驱动的记忆策略递归自我改进（RSI）机制。系统追踪一次失败涉及的信息保留、检索和时效判断等环节，提出针对性的规则修复，再保持基础模型与机器人控制器不变，通过独立回放检验修复效果。通过验证的策略用于后续任务，新的失败再推动下一轮迭代，让任务经验逐步沉淀为可复用的记忆管理策略。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f33ff44b-de72-4e26-b078-d4a1b43b16f5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:366,&quot;width&quot;:618,&quot;currHeight&quot;:366,&quot;currWidth&quot;:618,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:366,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:618,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLi43bT7xVoL7n2xy1J9cRj5xnre%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Li43bT7xVoL7n2xy1J9cRj5xnre&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:185408,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad972012258a.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5922330097087378" data-type="png" data-w="618" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="618" data-height="366" data-backw="546" data-backh="323" data-imgfileid="100263882" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad972012258a.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">BetaMem 根据失败线索定位问题，提出局部修复，再经独立回放评估决定是否发布</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这套版本化、可回滚、带灰度测试的记忆主动迭代流程，在具身智能领域非常少见。绝大多数记忆系统规则写死，一旦上线很难安全迭代，而贝塔无限把软件工程里稳定可靠的发布治理思想引入记忆进化，规避了自我进化容易失控的风险。毕竟，没有回放门控的自我进化，本质上是用新错误替换旧错误。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">成绩单如下，以下结果均使用 9B 开源模型 Qwen3.5-9B 生成记忆。</span><byte-sheet-html-origin data-id="" data-version="4" data-is-embed="true" data-grid-line-hidden="false" data-copy-type="col"></byte-sheet-html-origin></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 0px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9720143102.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.3296875" data-s="300,640" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1280" style="width: 100%;" type="block" data-backw="546" data-backh="180" data-imgfileid="100263886" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9720143102.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;margin: 0px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mvhxyzd5ux4" data-mpa-action-id="mvhxyzdf1kxw" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888">该表由AI科技评论制作，数据来源于论文中表3-6</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">分项里最值得看的，是需要串联多条记录的题型。M3-Bench-robot 上，多细节、多跳和人物理解三类题，分别领先最强参照 15.96、23.51 和 27.93 个百分点。这与它把记忆组织成带身份、时间和来源的记录的思路吻合，答对这类题需要的是一条证据链，而不是几张相似的画面。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;59bb7088-8ac6-44a7-8606-b81f3d439060&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:345,&quot;width&quot;:780,&quot;currHeight&quot;:345,&quot;currWidth&quot;:780,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:345,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:780,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FNcQibyuxVokSKhxYDW4cdQdNnCc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;NcQibyuxVokSKhxYDW4cdQdNnCc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:106635,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9720169a12.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.4423076923076923" data-type="png" data-w="780" style="background-color: transparent;" data-width="780" data-height="345" data-imgfileid="100263885" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad9720169a12.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">消融实验同样有说服力。去掉与原话关联的来源证据，M3-Bench-robot 准确率从 48.08% 掉到 38.61%，损失 9.47 个百分点。写入学习的效果也很具体，生成的写入动作符合记忆库规则的比例，从 50.9% 升到 86.2%，超过教师模型的 72.0%，每条入库动作消耗的输出 token 从 224 降到 118，减少 47.3%。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">论文也坦陈了一些短板，但我们看重的是它的方向。把记忆做成可训练、可追溯、可回滚的系统，并拿出了可复核的数字，这已足够亮眼。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvhxm6uk1m2q"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad972019a656.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad972019a656.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">05</span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">走进家庭，想象空间在哪里</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">结合家庭场景的特征，我们更能体会到贝塔无限方案的精心设计。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">第一个特征，是</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">多变化</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">家庭不可能像工厂一样设置严格的 SOP，物件不会各归其位。钥匙昨天在玄关，今天在抽屉，明天被孩子带进房间。贝塔无限把证据与状态拆开，让机器人记住物品最新的样子，也记住物品一步步来到此处的过程。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">第二个特征，是</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">多主体</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">工业场景里，机器人遇到谁都可以做一样的处理，但在家里，不同的主人有不同的习惯、偏好、需求，机器人干活难度自然陡增。BetaMem 把动作主体和说话人分别归属到具体的画面与语音来源，人物理解题 78.43% 的成绩，落到家庭里就是分得清家里有几个人、各自做了什么。人物溯源能力，是家庭机器人落地非常关键的前置能力。如果一个系统分不清你和孩子，记再多内容也无用，反而是添乱。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">第三个特征，是</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">长周期</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">工业任务以分钟、小时计，家庭相处以周、月、年计。真正有用的家庭机器人，要归纳出主人的习惯，避免主人反复介绍物品、习惯和要求。同时，不把一次偶然当成偏好也很重要。贝塔无限对此的约束很明确，规律和程序必须经多次独立经历印证，单次事件不能固化成规则，这一定程度上能保证机器人行为的稳定性。让每一次相处积累的了解，成为下一次服务的基础，这才是长期记忆真正的价值。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">而决定这套系统能否真正进门的，是第四个特征——</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">信任</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">家庭机器人记录的是人的生活，用户迟早会问出一句话：“你怎么知道的？能删吗？”这不该是事后补的合规功能，而应当是记忆系统的生死线。贝塔无限的答案是把它做进架构里：读取按记录、按来源逐条检查权限，永久删除需授权并让派生内容与索引一并失效，端侧保存近期观察与本地身份，云端只接收有界字段和被许可的证据引用，云端不可用时本地照常工作。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">贝塔无限的整套设计，是为一个开放、多主体、长周期、且必须被信任的环境而生的，从根源上适配家庭机器人的核心诉求。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvhxmip112fw"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad97201d07c6.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad97201d07c6.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">06</span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">下一站，进入生活</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">当然，这四个特征并不专属于家庭。养老院里，机器人要认得每一位被照护者，记得各自的习惯与禁忌；零售门店，货架、库存和客流时刻在变，今天和昨天的情况不是一回事。只要机器人长期和人、和真实世界交互，就绕不开长期记忆的问题。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">不妨回到论文页眉那句副标题：</span><em><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Learning What Remains True as the World Changes</span></em><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，世界瞬息万变，当知晓何为真。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这句话妙在，它既是一道技术题，也是一道信任题。技术题是：机器人如何在一个随时都在变的世界里，分清曾经的真和现在的真。信任题是：当它给出答案，凭什么让人相信。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">贝塔无限在具身长记忆的工作，本质上是把这两道题并成一道来解——证据与状态分离，让曾经为真有案可查；状态进入动作与验证，让现在为真有据可依；记忆策略联合进化，让将来如何为真有法可循。在一众聚焦感知、控制、大模型调用的具身团队里，像贝塔无限这样，将具身长记忆作为公司第一主线、投入整套底层体系研发的玩家，其实并不多见。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">当然，这份答卷仍有两处空白：让记忆越用越好的独立实证，和真实家庭里的长期数据。前者需要更多实验，后者需要时间，九月底发布的首款机器人多米，会是一个观察的窗口。</span></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad97201efcfa.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.40816326530612246" data-s="300,640" data-type="jpeg" data-w="735" type="block" data-imgfileid="100255816" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad97201efcfa.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad972021a9ff.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.40816326530612246" data-s="300,640" data-type="jpeg" data-w="735" type="block" data-imgfileid="100243569" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad972021a9ff.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section><span data-lark-record-format="docx/record"></span></section><section><span data-mpa-action-id="mipr37w01zjd"></span></section>]]></description>
<category>人工智能</category>
<comments>https://www.leiphone.com/category/ai/jvyFCFgqJxJtOvjo.html#comments</comments>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:19:00 +0800</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
<title>全球算力价格指数启动 九章云极核心共建算力定价基准</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/industrynews/NV7ccFeqrbG1oHSS.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<p>10月21日，全球算力价格指数及综合信息服务平台在金融街论坛正式启动。该指数由中国经济信息社发起建设，旨在填补算力定价基准空白、完善算力价格形成体系，推动建立具有自主知识产权的中国算力价格基准。北京九章云极科技股份有限公司（下称“九章云极”）作为核心共建单位参与建设。</p><p>当前，人工智能产业快速发展，算力需求持续攀升，算力产业进入加速发展阶段。与此同时，算力市场仍缺乏统一的定价基准与公认的价格标尺，制约了产业协同与市场交易的效率。全球算力价格指数及综合信息服务平台的启动，将为算力跨规格、跨平台、跨区域比价与交易提供基础支撑，助力构建全球算力市场新秩序。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad97140ef8a5.png?imageView2/2/w/740"/>&nbsp;</p><p>九章云极创始人、董事长兼CEO方磊在启动仪式上表示，全球算力价格指数的推出，是给AI时代的生产力装上“度量衡”。过去大量算力停留在资源层，产业侧算不清成本，金融侧看不懂产出，地方园区难以开展精准招商。该指数及综合信息服务平台的建设，将异构调度、Token产出、利用率和交付效率转化为可观测、可比较、可服务的产业信号，对行业发展具有三重意义：一是让企业用算有账本，从追求规模转向按有效算力付费；二是让资本识别真正进入工业、科研、制造等实体场景的算力，形成服务锚点；三是为政策制定与园区布局提供标尺，减少重复建设，推动真实生产力落地。</p><p>为了让算力这种抽象资源变得可理解、可计价，指数引入了九章云极“一度算力”作为基础计量单位。简单来说，“一度算力”类似于电力行业的“一度电”：它把不同型号的硬件、不同架构的集群、不同规格的计算服务，折算成统一的标准计量单元。就像用户不需要关心发电厂用的是煤还是水，只需要知道一度电能做什么，算力需求方也不需要理解硬件差异或集群架构细节，只需要知道“一度算力”能支撑多少模型训练量、能处理多少推理请求。这一理念的落地，意味着算力有了像电力一样的“通用计量语言”，让算力从“看不懂的技术参数”变成“可比较、可交易、可核算的公共服务”。九章云极基于“一度算力（DCU）”的算力计量计价产业实践，也入选了工业和信息化部《2025年度新型信息基础设施协调发展典型案例》。</p><p>九章云极作为算力价格指数计量方法的共建方，将依托其在异构算力调度、算力计量标准（DCU）等领域的技术积累，参与指数编制方法论设计与数据采集体系搭建，为指数提供异构算力折算与有效算力计量支持。新华指数研究院执行院长曹占忠在活动现场介绍，全球算力价格指数将研制“标准化算力单元”基准定价规则，通过采集全球算力市场真实数据编制，用于监测算力价格水平、捕捉价格波动信号。同时，平台将汇聚全球算力供给、需求、交易、履约等多维信息，为全球算力供需对接、价格发布与跨境流通提供适配场景。</p><p>全球算力价格指数及综合信息服务平台的启动运营，标志着算力定价领域迈出关键一步。随着中国算力价格基准体系的逐步完善，算力价格将被世界看见、被世界引用，也将推动普惠算力更广泛地进入生产生活。</p><p><br/></p>]]></description>
<category>业界</category>
<comments>https://www.leiphone.com/category/industrynews/NV7ccFeqrbG1oHSS.html#comments</comments>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:13:00 +0800</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
<title>10-50万级全覆盖，千里智驾量产进入放量期</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/transportation/yM0HZ6Vj1HWAptLb.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" data-mpa-action-id="mqyzfe8e1o6q" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="2"><section data-mpa-template="t" data-nest-level="3"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mqyujg2k1kai" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="4"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr1sh6ji1dny" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="5"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" data-mpa-action-id="mqyyysh4f7z" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="6"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;" data-mpa-action-id="mlf0mwjx1fmf" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="7"><section data-role="outer" label="Powered by 135editor.com" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="8"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-top: 15px;margin-bottom: 5px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="9"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-top: 15px;margin-bottom: 15px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="10"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-right: 8px;padding-left: 8px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.7;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="11"><section style="text-align: center;" data-mpa-action-id="mtl8j4ty1esv" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="12" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970bf13d6d.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.8582020389249305" data-type="gif" data-w="1079" style="background-color:transparent;width:562px;height:481px;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/cCyjje3LibqVvAhV1Ns2Q3VNHCyw14ZbUafQa5zgyDFEibD2Hqnibl6o3YBua9ggO9CNQZ9EABw06Y3AK44dzhy2ZeH730gr9Faq1m7GZGNbE0/0?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="562" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="481" data-imgfileid="100103313" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970bf13d6d.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><section style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="8" data-mpa-action-id="mvhwnfu2rzs" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="9"><section data-pm-slice="3 4 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="10"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mc47wtwy1gqi" data-nest-level="11"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="12"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;width: 100%;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="13"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;grid-column-gap: 3px;align-self: flex-start;margin-bottom: -8px;background: #fff;padding-right: 6px;z-index: 1;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="14"><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section></section><section style="border-top: 1px solid #23648B;border-bottom: 1px solid #23648B;width: 100%;padding: 14px 0px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="14"><section style="background: #F3F3F3;padding: 12px;width: 100%;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><p yb-mpa-mark="mark-style-text" style="font-size: 14px;color: #2C2C2C;line-height: 24px;" data-mid=""><span leaf="">高端验证、主流复用、规模放量，千里智驾的市场路径走通了。</span></p></section></section><section style="display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;grid-column-gap: 3px;align-self: flex-end;margin-top: -8px;background: #fff;padding-left: 6px;z-index: 1;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="14"><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section data-pm-slice="2 2 []" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;text-align: right;line-height: 1.6em;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="11"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrtqb4vv6w" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;font-size: 14px;" data-nest-level="12"><br/></span></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvhwn7na9x5" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mvhwnftpxg5"><span leaf="">从50万元级大型SUV，到30万至50万元混动SUV，再到20万元级旅行车、15万元级城市小车以及10万至20万元主流家用车型，千里智驾正在走完一条“高端起步、主流复用、规模放量”的路径，不断挑战行业的增速记录。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvhwnftp17l6" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">得以形成量产奇迹，千里这条路径的节奏，比车型名单本身更值得看。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvhwnftp1o24" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">今年上半年，千里智驾的方案覆盖极氪、领克、smart等车型。9月和10月，搭载千里智驾方案的银河TT与银河战舰700相继上市，产品覆盖由此进入10万至20万元价格带。这不仅是新增两款量产车型，更意味着千里智驾完成了从高端能力验证到主流市场规模化应用的关键跨越。这家来自重庆的智驾公司，能在一年之间快速放量，源自它在智驾行业构建的独特生态位。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvhwnftpjrn" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">当前，智驾行业正处于两个窗口期叠加的阶段。一方面，AI大模型正在推动智驾系统从规则驱动向模型驱动演进，加速提升复杂场景下的感知、推理与决策能力，打开高阶智驾的能力上限。另一方面，行业竞争正在从“卷性能、卷功能”走向“卷量产、卷规模”，能否进入主流价格带、覆盖更多车型和用户，成为下一阶段竞争的关键。两个窗口叠在一起，行业竞争的节点已经来到规模放量。它不再只是功能象限的比拼，而是谁能同时获得市场规模、持续抬高技术上限，并把同一套能力快速复用到更多车型和价格带。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong mpa-font-style="mvhwnftpala" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">千里智驾的答案落在三个支点上。</span></span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvhwnftpkyx" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">第一个支点是市场。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">高阶智驾进入主流市场，稀缺的不只是单一车型项目，而是能够持续放量的品牌矩阵。千里智驾入场较晚，却已通过极氪9X、极氪8X、领克07GT和smart精灵#1号等车型，覆盖从高端到主流的多个价格区间。随着银河TT、银河战舰700落地，进一步进入10万至20万元价格带。吉利银河2025年销量近124万辆，2026年前三季度销量超过80万辆，这个基盘为千里智驾提供了跨车型、跨平台持续导入的规模入口，也构成了“高端验证、主流复用、规模放量”的市场路径。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;3803e117-4d6b-4c4d-a4bb-cf8cbb669f40&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1503,&quot;width&quot;:1078,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1503,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1078,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1503,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1078,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FEv79bgYSIocVqdxT17kcyYS0nY9%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Ev79bgYSIocVqdxT17kcyYS0nY9&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2187253,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mvhwo7oq229d" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970bf7f051.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.3942486085343229" data-type="png" data-w="1078" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;border-radius: 30px;" data-width="1078" data-height="1503" data-backw="578" data-backh="806" data-imgfileid="100103308" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970bf7f051.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" data-remoteid="" data-asynid="" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cCyjje3LibqXtWeo5B1VvIL7fzIqiay4dgC5ibpLgXSDEBEXSkRIib2V8icWEXHvvezSe1v19JAzHTwF12hQSjcBk3ed1YnfH3H7HryshbqLV7LA/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg" data-src="" align="" alt="" border="" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="" data-s="" data-type="png" data-w="" aria-label="" aria-braillelabel="" aria-description="" height="" hspace="" ismap="" opacity="" sizes="" style="background-color: transparent;font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" title="" type="" usemap="" vspace="" width="" data-width="1078" data-height="1503" data-croporisrc="" data-cropx1="" data-cropx2="" data-cropy1="" data-cropy2="" data-cropselx1="" data-cropselx2="" data-cropsely1="" data-cropsely2="" data-backw="" data-backh="" data-copyright="" data-oversubscription-url="" data-before-oversubscription-url="" data-galleryid="" data-gallerysupplier="" data-cardimg="" data-fileid="" data-imgfileid="100103304" data-positionback="" data-imgqrcoded="" data-imgid="" data-upload="" data-fromlib="" data-aiimageid="" data-aiimagesource="" data-cacheurl="" data-retry="" data-ignore-width="" mpa-font-style="mvhwnftp1npc"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">支撑这条路径的，是千里智驾依托AI原生基因选择的“AI+车”路线。它以AI大模型能力为核心，早期借极氪9X等车型完成高阶市场的量产验证，同时以开放平台连接芯片生态、算力、激光雷达等软硬件伙伴。战略级汽车客户、AI原生基因、链式协同生态，三者叠加，构成了它在行业里难以复制的位置。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvhwnftp24i6" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">第二个支点是模型。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">AI大模型正在成为高阶智驾的新分水岭，规则决定功能下限，模型决定能力上限，统一架构则决定能力能否快速复制。千里科技与阶跃星辰达成全面战略合作，联合打造原生智驾基座模型，走“脑体协同”路径，在预训练阶段就把通用语料与智驾数据深度融合，使模型从训练起点便面向真实道路，形成对复杂环境的识别、推理与决策能力。在架构层面，千里以L4级统一技术架构驱动，把部分L4技术释放到量产车型，让同一套技术底座能够支撑不同定位的产品。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvhwnftpljq" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">技术储备也有具体落点。2026年9月，千里智驾联合电子科技大学、东南大学、北京邮电大学、天津大学发布并开源世界-动作模型WA-JEPA（arXiv:2608.20974），在世界模型这一前沿方向上拿出了可查的成果。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvhwnftpndt" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">第三个支点是数据。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">智驾行业正在从“比功能”转向“比迭代”，量产规模不仅是市场结果，也成为模型进化的生产资料。车辆产生的真实里程和长尾场景，经采集车、测试车、量产车及超算集群完成训练与验证，再反哺模型，形成天级数据闭环能力。随着主流车型放量，更多数据将持续推动模型与体验升级，进一步扩大用户使用与车型搭载，形成“规模产生数据、数据训练模型、模型提升体验、体验推动增长”的持续飞轮。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvhwnftp24i1" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">银河TT与银河战舰700的落地，是千里智驾进入主流市场的重要节点，但不是终点。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">接下来，千里智驾将由单车型量产，逐步走向品牌矩阵和多价格带的规模化应用。真正改变棋局的，是银河品牌体系的全面接入。此前，极氪、领克、smart等品牌完成了能力与口碑的验证；银河的加入，则把验证过的能力直接接入一个年销百万级的品牌体系。这意味着千里智驾在银河体系内的搭载规模，不再是“逐车型谈判”的线性增长，而是跟着一个可持续放量的基盘同步放大。规模化目标正在从一句商业愿景，变成一张有明确路径的时间表。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvhwnftpqtd" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">这一进程并非没有参照系。据易车榜2026半年度数据，在40万元以上高端车型市场，千里智驾城市NOA搭载市占率达40.8%，整体L2+智驾市占率达39.2%，两项均位列第一。在最挑剔的高端用户市场里拿到双第一，验证的是当下。</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">随着银河车型放量，10万至20万元主流价格带的城市NOA搭载量，将成为下一阶段的观察窗口。</span></span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvhwnftpf0d" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">值得注意的还有定位本身。千里科技并非一家智驾算法供应商，它以AI模型为核心，连接芯片生态、算力、整车和用户场景，同时覆盖智能驾驶与智能座舱，正在形成一个横跨高端与主流价格带、兼顾开放合作与全栈协同，并由辅助驾驶持续向L4演进的智能汽车平台。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;4aa66649-5a07-4e41-a5d5-d4aa2f8a40a5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:2880,&quot;width&quot;:5120,&quot;currHeight&quot;:2880,&quot;currWidth&quot;:5120,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:2880,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:5120,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FMj8nb0VxQoYMzexSxwJcx8kOnLd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Mj8nb0VxQoYMzexSxwJcx8kOnLd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2432637,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mvhwozzu1i9f" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970bfb9e41.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5625" data-type="png" data-w="5120" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;border-radius: 30px;" data-width="5120" data-height="2880" data-backw="578" data-backh="325" data-imgfileid="100103309" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970bfb9e41.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" data-remoteid="" data-asynid="" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/cCyjje3LibqULbfRSMpjiacJyBhhHOQSrRLkk25xKJlRqGiaqBS5T1HI65OpnxRPlOtYla4M81IWkKUllpkBNmAiahE6JScLn3NqKqt61fBr820/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg" data-src="" align="" alt="" border="" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="" data-s="" data-type="png" data-w="" aria-label="" aria-braillelabel="" aria-description="" height="" hspace="" ismap="" opacity="" sizes="" style="background-color: transparent;font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" title="" type="" usemap="" vspace="" width="" data-width="5120" data-height="2880" data-croporisrc="" data-cropx1="" data-cropx2="" data-cropy1="" data-cropy2="" data-cropselx1="" data-cropselx2="" data-cropsely1="" data-cropsely2="" data-backw="" data-backh="" data-copyright="" data-oversubscription-url="" data-before-oversubscription-url="" data-galleryid="" data-gallerysupplier="" data-cardimg="" data-fileid="" data-imgfileid="100103305" data-positionback="" data-imgqrcoded="" data-imgid="" data-upload="" data-fromlib="" data-aiimageid="" data-aiimagesource="" data-cacheurl="" data-retry="" data-ignore-width="" mpa-font-style="mvhwnftp6ea"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px">从50万级到10万级，“千里速度”的下一程，才刚刚开始。</span></span></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" data-from="yb-recommend-list" data-mpa-action-id="mvhwm6si1tq5" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" data-from="yb-recommend" data-recommend-article-type="normal" data-recomment-template-id="1" data-recommend-article-id="1000002321_1" data-recommend-article-time="1750932600" data-recommend-article-cover="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/DyDSsAWSoVuTpmq9eOF7ubmNkiaFHVdqcicHwmVKFsBDUqAF7zsKyn0aMgdKtrwZMtWMEoPd9EdwKF9xqAjbTKFA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-recommend-article-title="千里智驾RLM大模型，是智驾系统的下一条通路" data-recommend-article-content-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Wuoa5KjlOgzlyDrLthF0mQ"><section data-recommend-type="normal" data-recommend-tid="1" style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><section style="width: 100%;background: #ffffff;display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid=""><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><span style="width: 100%;flex:1;" class="js_jump_icon h5_image_link"><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNjk5NjIzNw==&mid=2247578876&idx=1&sn=63ee8c7cb49ca149626b2abfd503c3fe&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span leaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970c000f81.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.46" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="750" style="width: 100%;max-height: none;object-fit: cover;background-color: transparent;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cCyjje3LibqUUPbVYYUb0DSLxbPIMY6AibTeA4aXtSy72YlEZApg1luQzf82RZjIOvBz0PBkkB4USeDrHtDbUJP9oud20jtJerVxomeLdbXQg/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="578" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="231" data-imgfileid="100103315" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970c000f81.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></a></span></section><section style="width: 100%;padding: 9px 7px 8px;background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);font-size: 13px;font-weight: 400;color: #ffffff;line-height: 18px;margin-top: -35px;z-index: 20;" data-mid=""><p data-recommend-title="t" data-mid=""><span leaf=""><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNjk5NjIzNw==&mid=2247578876&idx=1&sn=63ee8c7cb49ca149626b2abfd503c3fe&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span textstyle="" style="color: #FFFFFF">千里智驾RLM大模型，是智驾系统的下一条通路</span></a></span></p></section></section></section></section><span leaf=""><br/></span><section data-mpa-template="t" data-from="yb-recommend" data-recommend-article-type="normal" data-recomment-template-id="1" data-recommend-article-id="1000002560_1" data-recommend-article-time="1788866251" data-recommend-article-cover="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/cCyjje3LibqXgteBdR3NASB3vGZ92YWhsCHerV5ZPiaXWYHQEr9qdVHia03VgN6m9MZiaOTVJJI74piceznfia8RiaJ17gicb15h7NzUictibfr0NlqiaA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-recommend-article-title="三位智驾大佬回应：Cybercab上路后，L4还需要激光雷达吗？" data-recommend-article-content-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yWJ_ReNprCUK1MtGpoZJDw"><section data-recommend-type="normal" data-recommend-tid="1" style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><section style="width: 100%;background: #ffffff;display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid=""><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><span style="width: 100%;flex:1;" class="js_jump_icon h5_image_link"><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNjk5NjIzNw==&mid=2247586482&idx=1&sn=93cce1689816e375378f866339a6e1d2&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span leaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970c026b77.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.4249767008387698" data-w="1073" style="width: 100%;max-height: none;object-fit: cover;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970c026b77.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></a></span></section><section style="width: 100%;padding: 9px 7px 8px;background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);font-size: 13px;font-weight: 400;color: #ffffff;line-height: 18px;margin-top: -35px;z-index: 20;" data-mid=""><p data-recommend-title="t" data-mid=""><span leaf=""><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNjk5NjIzNw==&mid=2247586482&idx=1&sn=93cce1689816e375378f866339a6e1d2&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span textstyle="" style="color: #FFFFFF">三位智驾大佬回应：Cybercab上路后，L4还需要激光雷达吗？</span></a></span></p></section></section></section></section><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr1sh6ji1dny" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="5"><section style="text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);" data-pm-slice="9 7 []" data-nest-level="4"><section powered-by="ezDrop" data-wechat="ezDrop" label="ezDrop 微信SVG交互图文排版插件 版权所有" style="overflow: hidden;line-height: 0;margin-bottom: 0px;"><section style="line-height:0;font-size:0px;margin:-1px 0 0;overflow: hidden;" data-copyright="ezDrop"><section style="height:0;"><section style="line-height:0;font-size:0px;overflow: hidden;transform-origin: 88% 23.1%;transform: scale(23);opacity: 0;" data-tech="ezDrop"><section class="custom_select_card_wrp mp_profile_iframe_wrp" nodeleaf=""><mp-common-profile class="js_uneditable custom_select_card mp_profile_iframe" data-pluginname="mpprofile" data-nickname="新智驾" data-alias="AI-Drive" data-from="2" data-headimg="http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DyDSsAWSoVtBXQuVBwAfwfLicA8RicNDp1vS66KVMJMMICQXuUl6U92hDRicG4ARKkqoY95nQcCPpUxpT80Tasq7Q/0?wx_fmt=png" data-signature="雷峰网旗下汽车频道。关注智能汽车产业链，自动驾驶技术应用。" data-id="MzAxNjk5NjIzNw==" data-is_biz_ban="0" data-service_type="1" data-verify_status="2"></mp-common-profile></section></section></section><section style="line-height:0;font-size:0px;pointer-events:none;" data-copyright="ezDrop"><strong><svg style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;pointer-events:none;transform: scale(1);" viewbox="0 0 900 358" data-copyright="ezDrop"><foreignobject x="0" y="0" width="100%" height="100%" data-tech="ezDrop"><span leaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970c054916.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.3977777777777778" data-w="900" style="width: 100%;pointer-events: none;-webkit-user-drag: none;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970c054916.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970c0628e0.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.3977777777777778" data-type="jpeg" data-w="900" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline: 0px;vertical-align: bottom;pointer-events: none;-webkit-user-drag: none;background-color: transparent;width: 900px !important;visibility: visible !important;height: auto !important;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261022/6ad970c0628e0.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></foreignobject></svg></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="display: none;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
